guide polestar-completionist-horde/raid-zulgurub
title Zul'Gurub (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 58-61
zone Stranglethorn Vale
pitch Zul'Gurub, in Stranglethorn Vale. A raid.
why Every Horde quest of Zul'Gurub: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Stranglethorn Vale: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

